{"ticker":"FIX","updated":"2026-11-06T23:57:15Z","profile":{"longName":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc.","shortName":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","country":"United States","website":"https://comfortsystemsusa.com","fullTimeEmployees":22700,"marketCap":35810230272,"trailingPE":21.976242,"forwardPE":15.167376,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.854916,"pegRatio":0.29,"targetMeanPrice":1820.5555,"targetHighPrice":2053.0,"targetLowPrice":1050.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":9,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.537,"earningsGrowth":0.686,"grossMargins":0.25698,"operatingMargins":0.16469999,"profitMargins":0.1301,"totalRevenue":12543356928,"beta":1.643,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":2073.99,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":841.66,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.41},"summary":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides mechanical and electrical installation, renovation, maintenance, repair, and replacement services for the mechanical and electrical services industry in the United States. The company operates through two segments: Mechanical and Electrical. It offers heating, ventilation, and air conditioning systems, as well as plumbing, electrical, piping and controls, off-site construction, monitoring, and fire protection. The company is also involved in the design, engineering, integration, installation, and start-up of mechanical, electrical, and plumbing (MEP) and related systems in new buildings; and renovation, expansion, maintenance, monitoring, repair, and replacement of systems in existing buildings. In addition, it provides remote monitoring of power usage, temperature, pressure, humidity and air flow for MEP and other building systems. The company serves building owners and developers, general contractors, architects, consulting engineers, and property managers in the commercial, industrial, and institutional markets. Comfort Systems USA, Inc. was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc. 及其子公司為美國機電服務業提供機電安裝、翻新、維護、修理和更換服務。該公司透過兩個部門運作：機械部門和電氣部門。它提供暖氣、通風和空調系統，以及管道、電氣、管道和控制、場外施工、監控和消防。該公司還參與新建築中機械、電氣和管道 (MEP) 及相關係統的設計、工程、整合、安裝和啟動；現有建築物系統的改造、擴建、維護、監控、維修和更換。此外，它還為 MEP 和其他建築系統提供電力使用、溫度、壓力、濕度和氣流的遠端監控。該公司為商業、工業和機構市場的業主和開發商、總承包商、建築師、諮詢工程師和物業經理提供服務。 Comfort Systems USA, Inc. 成立於 1917 年，總部位於德州休士頓。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"工程與建築","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":712.0,"h":718.39,"l":703.75,"c":715.87,"v":337900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":717.15,"h":717.5,"l":698.06,"c":709.53,"v":311600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":726.79,"h":757.12,"l":721.87,"c":752.1,"v":616700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":763.68,"h":772.22,"l":755.0,"c":764.91,"v":559800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":762.48,"h":770.18,"l":751.85,"c":753.69,"v":301700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":758.0,"h":782.46,"l":755.0,"c":782.05,"v":397000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":780.52,"h":785.23,"l":768.92,"c":777.18,"v":406100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":781.1,"h":782.7,"l":757.88,"c":762.91,"v":533000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":768.09,"h":806.58,"l":767.33,"c":799.38,"v":366300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":798.9,"h":802.63,"l":782.86,"c":797.71,"v":685900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":792.53,"h":824.29,"l":791.21,"c":821.62,"v":424600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":818.43,"h":825.0,"l":795.05,"c":804.24,"v":332900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":811.19,"h":817.34,"l":787.87,"c":791.46,"v":284400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":776.29,"h":789.67,"l":757.0,"c":781.88,"v":469700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":784.61,"h":807.97,"l":780.0,"c":804.36,"v":287700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":814.59,"h":823.5,"l":799.42,"c":801.8,"v":300100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":807.84,"h":827.97,"l":805.26,"c":825.18,"v":309400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":813.07,"h":843.8,"l":811.75,"c":834.33,"v":296600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":835.89,"h":852.31,"l":820.0,"c":832.98,"v":305000},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":838.1,"h":840.78,"l":816.0,"c":818.01,"v":285400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":829.72,"h":842.96,"l":823.25,"c":825.42,"v":245900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":8